('164', 'name-correction-form', 'Marksheet Name Correction & Affidavit Portal', 'examination', 'EXAMINATION · NAME CORRECTION & AFFIDAVIT CELL', 'Official application form, affidavit formats, 10th certificate verification guidelines, and step-by-step procedure for correcting spelling errors in student/parent names.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-building-enhanced.jpg', 'Student & Father Name Correction Secretariat', 'The Examination & Academic Registration Branch at RKDF University Bhopal provides an official portal for rectifying spelling errors in Student Name, Father\'s Name, or Mother\'s Name on semester marksheets, grade cards, and degree certificates.\n\nStudents seeking name correction must submit the prescribed application form along with a self-attested copy of their 10th/Matriculation Certificate (as official proof of name) and the original erroneous marksheet for replacement.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, name correction marksheet, name correction form, affidavit format', 'Marksheet Name Correction & Affidavit Portal - RKDF University Bhopal. Download official name correction application forms.', '1', '6', '2026-08-14 11:37:54'),
('165', 'migration-hindi', 'प्रव्रजन प्रमाणपत्र आवेदन पत्र (हिंदी)', 'examination', 'परीक्षा शाखा · माइग्रेशन एवं उपाधि पत्र (हिंदी)', 'आरकेडीएफ विश्वविद्यालय भोपाल से माइग्रेशन प्रमाणपत्र, प्रोविजनल डिग्री, एवं मूल उपाधि प्राप्त करने हेतु हिंदी आवेदन पत्र एवं दिशानिर्देश।', 'images/lovable/rkdf-building-enhanced.jpg', 'माइग्रेशन एवं प्रोविजनल प्रमाणपत्र शाखा (हिंदी)', 'आरकेडीएफ विश्वविद्यालय भोपाल के परीक्षा एवं अकादमिक पंजीयन विभाग द्वारा प्रव्रजन प्रमाणपत्र (Migration Certificate), प्रोविजनल डिग्री, एवं मूल उपाधि पत्र प्राप्त करने हेतु हिंदी आवेदन पत्र की सुविधा उपलब्ध कराई गई है।\n\nउच्च अध्ययन अथवा अन्य विश्वविद्यालय में प्रवेश हेतु प्रस्थान करने वाले छात्र/छात्राएं निर्धारित शुल्क एवं अनापत्ति प्रमाणपत्र (No Dues Certificate) के साथ हिंदी में आवेदन पत्र डाउनलोड करके प्रस्तुत कर सकते हैं।', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, degree migration form hindi, migration certificate', 'Degree Migration Form (Hindi) - RKDF University Bhopal. Download official migration application forms in Hindi.', '1', '7', '2026-08-14 11:39:50'),
('166', 'migration-english', 'Degree & Migration Certificate Form (English)', 'examination', 'EXAMINATION · MIGRATION & DEGREE CELL', 'Official application forms and procedures for obtaining Migration Certificates, Provisional Degrees, and Original Convocation Certificates.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-building-enhanced.jpg', 'Migration & Provisional Degree Secretariat', 'The Examination Branch Secretariat at RKDF University Bhopal provides official application forms for obtaining Migration Certificates, Provisional Degrees, and Original Degree Certificates in English.\n\nGraduating students and alumni moving to higher educational institutions or foreign universities can download the prescribed application forms below, complete the No Dues clearance, and submit to the Controller of Examinations.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, degree migration form english, migration certificate form', 'Degree Migration Form (English) - RKDF University Bhopal. Download official migration forms.', '1', '8', '2026-08-14 11:39:50'),
('167', 'alumni-form', 'Alumni Registration & Feedback Form Portal', 'student-corner', 'RKDF GLOBAL ALUMNI NETWORK · REGISTRATION & FEEDBACK', 'Official registration form, feedback submission, alumni association membership guidelines, and network directory for RKDF University graduates.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-building-enhanced.jpg', 'Alumni Association Secretariat', 'Welcome to the RKDF University Global Alumni Association Membership & Registration Portal. We invite all graduates and alumni scholars across engineering, medical, management, science, agriculture, and humanities disciplines to register, update their contact profiles, submit feedback, and join our global professional network.\n\nAlumni can fill out the online registration form or download printable PDF application forms below.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, alumni form, alumni registration, alumni feedback form', 'Alumni Registration & Feedback Form Portal - RKDF University Bhopal. Register online or download alumni membership forms.', '1', '9', '2026-08-14 11:42:11'),
('170', 'rnd-glance', 'Projects At A Glance', 'rnd', 'R&D · PROJECTS GLANCE', 'Summary overview of major research grants, labs & technology patents.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'Research Grants & Innovations At A Glance', 'Highlights of ongoing research labs, grants & publications.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, projects at a glance', 'Summary overview of major research grants, labs & technology patents.', '1', '2', '2026-08-06 15:15:06'),
('171', 'journals', 'Shodh Sangam Journals', 'rnd', 'R&D · JOURNALS', 'Official peer-reviewed research journals published by RKDF University Bhopal.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-library.jpg', 'Shodh Sangam Research Journal Portal', 'Bi-annual multi-disciplinary international research journal.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, shodh sangam journals', 'Official peer-reviewed research journals published by RKDF University Bhopal.', '1', '3', '2026-08-06 15:15:06'),
('172', 'rnd-presentation', 'Overview Presentation', 'rnd', 'R&D · PRESENTATION', 'Executive PPT presentation detailing R&D infrastructure, labs & achievements.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'R&D Infrastructure Overview Presentation', 'Visual overview of university research infrastructure and grants.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, overview presentation', 'Executive PPT presentation detailing R&D infrastructure, labs & achievements.', '1', '4', '2026-08-06 15:15:06'),
('173', 'rnd-formats', 'R&D Formats (Download)', 'rnd', 'R&D · FORMATS', 'Download official formats for research project proposal submission.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-library.jpg', 'R&D Project Proposal Formats & Templates', 'Download ZIP archive containing project proposal formats.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, r&d formats (download)', 'Download official formats for research project proposal submission.', '1', '5', '2026-08-06 15:15:06'),
('174', 'funding-agencies', 'Funding Agencies', 'rnd', 'R&D · FUNDING AGENCIES', 'Directory of national & international research project funding bodies.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'Research Project Funding Agencies Directory', 'DST, DBT, CSIR, ICMR, AICTE, ISRO, and MNRE grant schemes.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, funding agencies', 'Directory of national & international research project funding bodies.', '1', '6', '2026-08-06 15:15:06'),
('175', 'publications', 'List of Publications', 'rnd', 'R&D · PUBLICATIONS', 'Cumulative list of Scopus/WoS indexed research papers published by faculty.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-library.jpg', 'Faculty Research Publications Directory', 'List of published research articles in high impact journals.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, list of publications', 'Cumulative list of Scopus/WoS indexed research papers published by faculty.', '1', '7', '2026-08-06 15:15:06'),
('176', 'mou-list', 'List of MoU', 'rnd', 'R&D · MOUS & PARTNERSHIPS', 'List of active Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with corporate industries.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-why-bg.jpg', 'Industrial & Academic MOUs Directory', 'Strategic partnerships for joint research and internships.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, list of mou', 'List of active Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with corporate industries.', '1', '8', '2026-08-06 15:15:06'),
('178', 'conferences', 'Industrial Visits & Conferences', 'rnd', 'R&D · CONFERENCES', 'National & international conferences, industrial visits, and workshops.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-building-enhanced.jpg', 'Industrial Visits & Academic Conferences', 'Reports on industrial study tours, seminars, and fests.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, industrial visits & conferences', 'National & international conferences, industrial visits, and workshops.', '1', '10', '2026-08-06 15:15:06'),
('179', 'rnd-videos', 'R&D Videos', 'rnd', 'R&D · VIDEOS', 'Video demonstrations of research laboratories, solar carbon plant & innovation.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'R&D Video Demonstrations & Media', 'Watch video walkthroughs of carbon capture research plants.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, r&d videos', 'Video demonstrations of research laboratories, solar carbon plant & innovation.', '1', '11', '2026-08-06 15:15:06'),
('182', 'phd-syllabus', 'Ph.D Coursework Scheme & Syllabus Portal', 'rnd', 'DOCTORAL STUDIES · COURSEWORK SYLLABUS', 'Pre-Ph.D coursework scheme, research methodology syllabus, and subject-specific modules.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'Pre-Ph.D Coursework & Examination Syllabus', 'All enrolled Ph.D scholars must successfully complete mandatory Pre-Ph.D Coursework comprising Research Methodology, Quantitative Techniques, Research Ethics, and Advanced Subject Electives.\n\nSyllabus documents for all research disciplines can be accessed below.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, course work-scheme & syllabus', 'Coursework scheme, Research Methodology syllabus & credit structure for Ph.D.', '1', '3', '2026-08-14 11:56:05');
REPLACE INTO `site_pages` (`id`, `page_slug`, `page_title`, `category`, `eyebrow`, `hero_subtitle`, `hero_bg_image`, `intro_heading`, `intro_text`, `meta_keywords`, `meta_description`, `is_active`, `sort_order`, `updated_at`) VALUES
('183', 'phd-students', 'Registered Ph.D Research Scholars Directory', 'rnd', 'DOCTORAL STUDIES · SCHOLARS DIRECTORY', 'Comprehensive directory of enrolled and awarded Ph.D research scholars, topic titles, and supervisors.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'Ph.D Scholars & Awardees Directory', 'RKDF University takes pride in its community of research scholars engaged in high-impact scientific and social research.\n\nThe complete registry of registered doctoral candidates, synopsis titles, and awarded Ph.D scholars is maintained below.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, ph.d students directory', 'Directory of registered Ph.D research scholars, topic titles & supervisor names.', '1', '4', '2026-08-14 11:56:05'),
('184', 'phd-admissions-2026', 'Ph.D Admissions 2026 Notification & Prospectus', 'rnd', 'DOCTORAL STUDIES · ADMISSIONS 2026', 'Notification for Ph.D Entrance Examination 2026, important dates, key research areas, and application form.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'Ph.D Entrance Examination 2026 Call for Applications', 'Applications are invited from eligible candidates for admission to Ph.D programs for the academic session 2026-27.\n\nFellowships and research assistantships are available for outstanding GATE / NET qualified scholars.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, ph.d admissions 2026', 'Notification for Ph.D Entrance Test 2026 session.', '1', '5', '2026-08-14 11:56:05'),
('185', 'supervisors', 'Approved Ph.D Guides & Research Supervisors', 'rnd', 'DOCTORAL STUDIES · RESEARCH SUPERVISORS', 'Directory of approved Ph.D research supervisors, faculty designations, and vacancy positions.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'Approved Ph.D Research Guides Directory', 'All doctoral research at RKDF University is guided by experienced Senior Professors, Associate Professors, and recognized research scientists.\n\nScholars can consult the approved guide list to select research supervisors according to domain specialization.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, list of supervisors', 'Directory of approved Ph.D research guides and supervisors.', '1', '6', '2026-08-14 11:56:05'),
('186', 'research-policy', 'University Research Policy & Ethics Guidelines', 'rnd', 'RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT · RESEARCH POLICY', 'Official research policy governing ethical research conduct, seed grants, publications, and patents.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'RKDF University Research Governance Framework', 'The University Research Policy aims to foster a strong research culture, maintain high standards of academic integrity, support interdisciplinary innovation, and provide financial incentives for high-impact journal publications.\n\nThe complete policy document approved by the Governing Body is available below.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, research policy of university', 'Official university research policy governing ethical research & grants.', '1', '7', '2026-08-14 11:56:05'),
('187', 'consultancy-policy', 'Institutional Consultancy & Testing Policy', 'rnd', 'RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT · CONSULTANCY POLICY', 'Policy guidelines governing industrial consultancy projects, material testing services, and revenue sharing.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'Industrial Consultancy & Material Testing Services', 'RKDF University actively encourages faculty members and department laboratories to undertake industrial consultancy, technical testing, and advisory projects for government and corporate organizations.\n\nThe Consultancy Policy defines transparent revenue sharing norms between faculty consultants and the university.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, consultancy policy of university', 'Official consultancy policy governing corporate testing & projects.', '1', '8', '2026-08-14 11:56:05'),
('188', 'institutional-distinctiveness', 'Institutional Distinctiveness Performance Report', 'rnd', 'QUALITY ASSURANCE · INSTITUTIONAL DISTINCTIVENESS', 'Report on university distinctiveness in clean energy, solar carbon capture technology, and rural societal outreach.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'Pioneering Clean Energy & Technological Innovation', 'RKDF University\'s institutional distinctiveness lies in its pioneering research in Solar-Integrated Carbon Capture Technology, renewable energy microgrids, and extensive community healthcare outreach.\n\nOur carbon capture pilot plant represents a benchmark in academic-driven climate mitigation.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, institutional distinctiveness', 'Report on university distinctiveness in clean energy & societal outreach.', '1', '9', '2026-08-14 11:56:05'),
('189', 'govt-projects', 'Govt of India Sponsored Research Projects', 'rnd', 'SPONSORED RESEARCH · GOVT PROJECTS', 'Major research projects sanctioned by Ministries and agencies of the Government of India (DST, ISRO, AICTE, DBT).', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'Government Funded Research Grants Directory', 'RKDF University has received research grants from premier Central Government agencies including Department of Science & Technology (DST), ISRO, CSIR, AICTE, and Ministry of New & Renewable Energy (MNRE).\n\nThese projects address national priorities in clean energy, health, and advanced materials.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, projects of govt of india', 'Major research projects sanctioned by Govt of India ministries.', '1', '10', '2026-08-14 11:56:05'),
('190', 'csir-projects', 'CSIR Sponsored Research Projects at RKDF', 'rnd', 'SPONSORED RESEARCH · CSIR PROJECTS', 'Presentation and progress reports on Council of Scientific & Industrial Research (CSIR) funded projects.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'CSIR Funded Chemical & Engineering Research', 'Research projects funded by CSIR at RKDF University focus on organic synthesis, chemical catalysis, and environmental remediation.\n\nThe research team actively collaborates with CSIR laboratories across India.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, csir projects at rkdf', 'CSIR sponsored research projects presentation and output.', '1', '11', '2026-08-14 11:56:05'),
('191', 'solar-carbon-report', 'Solar Integrated Carbon Capture Plant Technical Report', 'rnd', 'CLEAN TECH RESEARCH · CARBON CAPTURE', 'Technical report on the University\'s flagship Solar-Integrated Carbon Capture Research Plant.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'Flagship Carbon Sequestration Research Facility', 'The Solar Integrated Carbon Capture Research Plant at RKDF University is an innovative research facility designed to capture industrial CO2 emissions using solar thermal energy.\n\nThe complete technical report and index of operational data are available below.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, solar carbon capture plant report', 'Technical report on Solar Integrated Carbon Capture Research Plant.', '1', '12', '2026-08-14 11:56:05'),
('192', 'incubation', 'RKDF Startup & Innovation Incubation Centre', 'rnd', 'ENTREPRENEURSHIP · INCUBATION CELL', 'Startup incubator providing seed funding, prototyping lab space, patent support, and corporate mentorship.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-research.jpg', 'Empowering Student & Faculty Entrepreneurs', 'The RKDF Incubation & Innovation Centre nurtures aspiring student entrepreneurs, technology innovators, and startup founders.\n\nIncubatees receive state-of-the-art office space, rapid prototyping labs, IP filing support, and access to angel investor networks.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, incubation centre', 'Startup incubation center providing funding, lab space & mentorship.', '1', '13', '2026-08-14 11:56:05'),
('211', 'alumni', 'Alumni Network & Global Association', 'About Us', 'ALUMNI NETWORK · RKDF UNIVERSITY BHOPAL', 'Connecting graduates across the globe — building strong professional networks, career opportunities, and lifelong university bonds.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-why-bg.jpg', 'Welcome to RKDF University Alumni Association', 'Any institution\'s Alumni are key to its growth. Once you graduate from RKDF University, you are forever an integral part of our global alumni network. Stay connected with fellow graduates, explore career opportunities, attend exclusive reunions, and enjoy lifelong membership benefits.', NULL, NULL, '1', '0', '2026-08-10 15:22:15'),
('212', 't&p', 'Training & Placement Cell', 'Academics', 'CAREER DEVELOPMENT · RKDF UNIVERSITY BHOPAL', 'Assisting students in achieving top placement offers, internships, pre-placement training, and industry-academia interactions.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-why-bg.jpg', 'Welcome to RKDF University Training & Placement Cell', 'The Training and Placement (T&P) Cell plays a major role in shaping the corporate readiness of our students. We collaborate with 300+ leading corporate organizations to secure lucrative job opportunities, conduct CV workshops, mock interview rounds, and live industry sessions.', NULL, NULL, '1', '0', '2026-08-10 15:33:41'),
('213', 'careers', 'Careers & Academic Recruitment', 'About Us', 'CAREERS · RKDF UNIVERSITY BHOPAL', 'Join the academic and research faculty at RKDF University Bhopal. Explore current walk-in interviews, research project fellowships, and faculty openings.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-campus-hero.jpg', 'Current Openings & Walk-In Interviews', 'RKDF University invites applications from dynamic, qualified scholars and faculty for teaching and research positions across diverse faculties including Agriculture, Engineering, Science, Law, Management, Ayurveda, and Homeopathy.', NULL, NULL, '1', '0', '2026-08-10 15:33:41'),
('214', 'ncc', 'National Cadet Corps (NCC)', 'Academics', 'YOUTH WING · RKDF UNIVERSITY BHOPAL', 'Fostering discipline, leadership, character building, and national service among university cadets.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-campus-hero.jpg', 'About National Cadet Corps (NCC) Unit', 'The National Cadet Corps (NCC) is the youth wing of the Indian Armed Forces. Established in 1948, it aims to develop character, comradeship, discipline, a secular outlook, the spirit of adventure, and ideals of selfless service among young citizens.', NULL, NULL, '1', '0', '2026-08-10 16:35:19'),
('215', 'eresource-login', 'Library E-Resource Portal Login', 'academic', 'CENTRAL LIBRARY · DIGITAL RESOURCES', '24/7 Portal access to national e-learning repositories, research databases, and e-journals for RKDF students.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-library.jpg', 'Student Identity & E-Resource Access Portal', 'RKDF University Central Library provides 24/7 access to digital e-resources, research databases, national e-learning portals, and international open-access repositories for all registered students, researchers, and faculty members.\n\nPlease enter your Enrollment Number below to verify your student identity and unlock full access to SWAYAM, Shodhganga, NDL, DELNET, NPTEL, ScienceDirect, and global university repositories.', 'rkdf, university, bhopal, e-resource login, library portal, swayam, shodhganga, ndl, delnet', 'Library E-Resource Login - RKDF University Bhopal. Access national digital repositories and e-learning portals.', '1', '35', '2026-08-14 11:02:08'),
('216', 'policies', 'University Policies & Statutory Regulations', 'About Us', 'STATUTORY GOVERNANCE · POLICIES & CODES', 'Official statutory policies, IT policy, research guidelines, ethics codes, anti-ragging rules, and accessibility standards.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-why-bg.jpg', 'Institutional Policies & Governance Framework', 'RKDF University Bhopal operates under robust statutory policies, governance regulations, and quality assurance frameworks approved by the Board of Management and Academic Council.\n\nBrowse and download official university policies, statutory committee guidelines, ethical codes of conduct, and accessibility standards below.', NULL, NULL, '1', '0', '2026-08-14 12:32:09'),
('217', 'terms&condition', 'Terms & Conditions of Use', 'About Us', 'LEGAL & COMPLIANCE · TERMS OF USE', 'Official terms and conditions governing the use of RKDF University website, online admission portal, and ERP e-services.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-why-bg.jpg', 'Website Terms & Conditions Framework', 'Welcome to the official web portal of RKDF University Bhopal. By accessing or using this website, online admission forms, or student ERP services, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms & Conditions of use.\n\nPlease read these statutory terms carefully before accessing university e-services.', NULL, NULL, '1', '0', '2026-08-14 12:33:34'),
('218', 'privacy', 'Institutional Privacy Policy', 'About Us', 'DATA PROTECTION · PRIVACY POLICY', 'Official privacy policy governing personal data protection, confidentiality agreements, and student record security.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-why-bg.jpg', 'Personal Data Protection & Security Framework', 'RKDF University Bhopal is committed to protecting the privacy, confidentiality, and security of personal information collected from students, graduates, faculty, and institutional partners.\n\nThis Privacy Policy outlines the standards governing personal data protection, employee confidentiality agreements, and authorized disclosures under university regulations.', NULL, NULL, '1', '0', '2026-08-14 12:34:52'),
('219', 'contact-us', 'Contact Us & Campus Directory', 'About Us', 'CONNECT WITH US · RKDF CAMPUS DIRECTORY', 'Campus address, official email contacts, administrative office phone numbers, toll-free admission helplines, and location map.', 'images/lovable/rkdf-why-bg.jpg', 'Get in Touch with RKDF University', 'RKDF University Bhopal welcomes inquiries from prospective students, parents, research scholars, corporate recruiters, and visitors.\n\nReach out to our campus offices, administrative deans, toll-free admission helpline, or submit your query online below.', NULL, NULL, '1', '0', '2026-08-14 12:40:33');
